 "refs": [
  {
   "title": "The conjugation chart",
   "html": "<div class=\"tblwrap\"><table class=\"ref\">\n  <thead><tr><th>Verb</th><th>io</th><th>tu</th><th>lui / lei</th><th>noi</th><th>voi</th><th>loro</th><th>Meaning</th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody><tr><td class=\"k c1\">andare</td><td>vado</td><td>vai</td><td>va</td><td>andiamo</td><td>andate</td><td>vanno</td><td>go</td></tr><tr><td class=\"k c1\">venire</td><td>vengo</td><td>vieni</td><td>viene</td><td>veniamo</td><td>venite</td><td>vengono</td><td>come</td></tr><tr><td class=\"k c1\">rimanere</td><td>rimango</td><td>rimani</td><td>rimane</td><td>rimaniamo</td><td>rimanete</td><td>rimangono</td><td>remain / stay</td></tr><tr><td class=\"k c1\">fare</td><td>faccio</td><td>fai</td><td>fa</td><td>facciamo</td><td>fate</td><td>fanno</td><td>do / make</td></tr><tr><td class=\"k c1\">stare</td><td>sto</td><td>stai</td><td>sta</td><td>stiamo</td><td>state</td><td>stanno</td><td>am (well) / stay</td></tr><tr><td class=\"k c1\">bere</td><td>bevo</td><td>bevi</td><td>beve</td><td>beviamo</td><td>bevete</td><td>bevono</td><td>drink</td></tr><tr><td class=\"k c1\">scegliere</td><td>scelgo</td><td>scegli</td><td>sceglie</td><td>scegliamo</td><td>scegliete</td><td>scelgono</td><td>choose</td></tr><tr><td class=\"k c1\">dire</td><td>dico</td><td>dici</td><td>dice</td><td>diciamo</td><td>dite</td><td>dicono</td><td>say / tell</td></tr><tr><td class=\"k c1\">uscire</td><td>esco</td><td>esci</td><td>esce</td><td>usciamo</td><td>uscite</td><td>escono</td><td>go out</td></tr><tr><td class=\"k c1\">salire</td><td>salgo</td><td>sali</td><td>sale</td><td>saliamo</td><td>salite</td><td>salgono</td><td>get on / climb</td></tr><tr><td class=\"k c1\">dare</td><td>do</td><td>dai</td><td>dà</td><td>diamo</td><td>date</td><td>danno</td><td>give</td></tr><tr><td class=\"k c2\">dovere</td><td>devo</td><td>devi</td><td>deve</td><td>dobbiamo</td><td>dovete</td><td>devono</td><td>must / have to</td></tr><tr><td class=\"k c2\">volere</td><td>voglio</td><td>vuoi</td><td>vuole</td><td>vogliamo</td><td>volete</td><td>vogliono</td><td>want</td></tr><tr><td class=\"k c2\">potere</td><td>posso</td><td>puoi</td><td>può</td><td>possiamo</td><td>potete</td><td>possono</td><td>can</td></tr><tr><td class=\"k c2\">sapere</td><td>so</td><td>sai</td><td>sa</td><td>sappiamo</td><td>sapete</td><td>sanno</td><td>know (how to)</td></tr></tbody>\n</table></div>\n<p class=\"reftip\">Patterns that cover several verbs: <b>io and loro add a g</b> (vengo, rimango, salgo, scelgo). Helping verbs are followed straight by the infinitive: <b>devo andare</b>, <b>posso venire</b>, <b>so cucinare</b>.</p>"
